---
import Base from '../../layouts/Base.astro';
import CaseStudyCard from '../../components/CaseStudyCard.astro';
---

<Base
  title="Work · Dilith Dinesh"
  description="Product case studies from two years inside field service operations at Zuper, plus an AI systems spec. Real decisions, real constraints, honest reflections on vertical SaaS and B2B product management."
>
  <div class="max-w-[1100px] mx-auto px-6 pt-[120px] pb-[80px]">

    <div class="max-w-[740px] mb-[80px]">
      <h1 class="font-display text-[48px] font-medium leading-tight text-primary">Work</h1>

      <p class="font-prose text-lg leading-reading text-primary mt-6">
        These aren't polished success stories.
        They're records of real decisions made under
        real constraints, what the problem actually was,
        what made it hard, what I chose, and what I'd
        do differently.
      </p>

      <p class="font-body text-base text-secondary mt-4">
        Three case studies. Two from inside field service operations,
        one written from a blank brief on an AI system.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="work-list">
      <a href="/work/golden-account-model" class="work-list-item reveal">
        <div class="work-list-num">01</div>
        <div class="work-list-body">
          <p class="work-list-tags">ZUPER  ·  FIELD SERVICE  ·  VERTICAL BUILD</p>
          <h2 class="work-list-title">The Roofing Vertical</h2>
          <p class="work-list-desc">The roofing vertical at Zuper didn't exist. No architecture, no repeatable process, no foundation for the product to grow on. I built it, from first discovery call to cloneable system.</p>
        </div>
        <span class="work-list-cta">Read the case study →</span>
      </a>

      <a href="/work/booking-stopgap" class="work-list-item reveal" style="transition-delay: 90ms">
        <div class="work-list-num">02</div>
        <div class="work-list-body">
          <p class="work-list-tags">ZUPER  ·  FIELD SERVICE  ·  PRODUCT JUDGMENT</p>
          <h2 class="work-list-title">The Stopgap That Knew Its Place</h2>
          <p class="work-list-desc">Roofing customers needed booking before the product roadmap was ready. I built the interim solution, and designed it to be replaced.</p>
        </div>
        <span class="work-list-cta">Read the case study →</span>
      </a>

      <a href="/work/ai-shopping-buddy" class="work-list-item reveal" style="transition-delay: 180ms">
        <div class="work-list-num">03</div>
        <div class="work-list-body">
          <p class="work-list-tags">PERSONAL SPEC  ·  E-COMMERCE  ·  AI SYSTEMS</p>
          <h2 class="work-list-title">The AI Shopping Buddy</h2>
          <p class="work-list-desc">A spec exercise, not shipped work: personal friction became a weekend build plan for an AI shopping layer any e-commerce can embed, so you never have to paste a spec sheet into Claude again.</p>
        </div>
        <span class="work-list-cta">Read the case study →</span>
      </a>
    </div>

<style>
  .work-list {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
  }

  .work-list-item {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 48px 1fr auto;
    align-items: start;
    gap: 0 32px;
    padding: 40px 0;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--color-border);
    text-decoration: none;
    transition: border-color 180ms var(--ease-ui);
  }
  .work-list-item:last-child {
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--color-border);
  }

  .work-list-num {
    font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif;
    font-size: 0.6875rem;
    font-weight: 500;
    letter-spacing: 0.14em;
    color: var(--color-secondary);
    padding-top: 5px;
    flex-shrink: 0;
  }

  .work-list-tags {
    font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif;
    font-size: 0.6875rem;
    font-weight: 500;
    letter-spacing: 0.14em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--color-secondary);
    margin-bottom: 12px;
    transition: color 180ms var(--ease-ui);
  }

  .work-list-title {
    font-family: 'Instrument Serif', 'Cabinet Grotesk', serif;
    font-size: 1.75rem;
    font-weight: 400;
    line-height: 1.1;
    letter-spacing: -0.015em;
    color: var(--color-primary);
    margin-bottom: 12px;
    transition: color 180ms var(--ease-ui);
  }

  .work-list-desc {
    font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif;
    font-size: 0.9375rem;
    line-height: 1.65;
    color: var(--color-secondary);
    max-width: 580px;
  }

  .work-list-cta {
    font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif;
    font-size: 0.875rem;
    font-weight: 500;
    color: var(--color-secondary);
    white-space: nowrap;
    padding-top: 6px;
    transition: color 180ms var(--ease-ui), transform 150ms var(--ease-ui);
    display: inline-block;
    flex-shrink: 0;
  }

  @media (hover: hover) and (pointer: fine) {
    .work-list-item:hover .work-list-title { color: var(--color-primary); }
    .work-list-item:hover .work-list-cta {
      color: var(--color-primary);
      transform: translateX(4px);
    }
  }
  .work-list-item:active { opacity: 0.75; }

  @media (max-width: 640px) {
    .work-list-item {
      grid-template-columns: 32px 1fr;
      grid-template-rows: auto auto;
      gap: 0 16px;
      padding: 28px 0;
    }
    .work-list-cta {
      grid-column: 2;
      margin-top: 12px;
    }
    .work-list-title { font-size: 1.4rem; }
  }
</style>

  </div>
</Base>
